# Citation metadata. GitHub reads it for the "Cite this repository" button;
# Zenodo reads it when archiving a release (there is no .zenodo.json, which
# would take precedence). version and date-released are left out on purpose:
# Zenodo takes them from the release tag, so they cannot go stale here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or software, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file, and attribute "Thai Open Transit" as required by the
  ODbL-1.0 data licence.
type: dataset
title: Thai Open Transit
abstract: >-
  An open, structured, versioned and time-aware dataset of Thailand's rail
  transit network, starting with Bangkok and its metropolitan region
  (Nonthaburi, Samut Prakan, Pathum Thani). Every station and segment
  carries validity windows and sourced milestones, so the network can be
  queried as it was on any date. Includes a reference web map.
authors:
  - given-names: Anupun
    family-names: Khumthong
    alias: Nukaze
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nukaze/thai-open-transit"
license:
  - ODbL-1.0
  - AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - Bangkok
  - Thailand
  - rail transit
  - open data
  - temporal data
  - GeoJSON
  - OpenStreetMap
